	I have found one of the sources of confusion about the purpose 
of this group.  In scouring bulletin boards for those carrying NetHack, 
I have come across two boards that also "store & forward" various 
Internet news groups.  The description for the group was wrong on both 
of them.  The Apogee board listed it as "game hackers and related 
topics".  I have notified both sysops that their descriptions are wrong, 
and forwarded to them a thread from this group showing the reaction to 
wrong posts.  So while the practice of posting crack requests to this 
group is bothersome, perhaps we should remember that some of the folks 
who send to the group from external sources (Compuserve, Bulletin 
Boards, etc) might _think_ that they _do_ have the proper group.



